{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（12日）早上10時許，警方接報西貢清水灣二灘對開約5米海面，有女泳客懷疑遇溺。人員到場時該名82歲楊姓女泳客已被由救生員救回上岸，惟昏迷不醒，隨即由救護車將她送往將軍澳醫院搶救，惜延至早上11時17分不治。死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>消息稱，女事主疑有心臟病。警方事後聯絡其家人到醫院跟進情況。</p><figure><img alt=\"警員在清水灣二灘調查事件。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175416550996316160152837.jpeg/hko-nMkupeMKSU1RR-rXSLTHeOfcN3S2l_IKJ5fyCic\"/><figcaption>警員在清水灣二灘調查事件。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到將軍澳醫院調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175400442411094016218365.jpeg/8YjjmKrCgY9KDv7xQhpnKTlj-PTyNx0D8_GKF9nxihc\"/><figcaption>警員到將軍澳醫院調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到將軍澳醫院調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175400694740422656719852.jpeg/36XIbZW10GMGtqYGFJi4xxS8gZIq8TSa-apORdyqTkU\"/><figcaption>警員到將軍澳醫院調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主由救護車送院。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175403192393928704501624.jpeg/6msP_MfpzuhRh0jzXa-1Iwwa-xK5DZYWYZ7TMWGe0zE\"/><figcaption>事主由救護車送院。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到將軍澳醫院調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175400697529765888905632.jpeg/biE91lBMXsM_uUPC2yPx0gcPc62dDFFUvr_aZ5u_2mc\"/><figcaption>警員到將軍澳醫院調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T04:58:39.616414+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":237,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}